              "sfdc_cms:schema" : {
                "readOnly" : true
              },
              "text" : "Dear {!$Expression.First_Name},<br /><br />We hope you are as excited as we are to be part of our Zeta community. <br /><br />Zeta Charter Schools began in 2018 with a dream for what education could make possible for students across New York City. At its heart was a simple idea: <strong>when you build a school around love for students, you build differently. <br /><br />What does it mean to build a school around love?</strong><br /><br />We often say <strong>Zeta is a love story</strong>. And we mean it. Every student in our schools is deeply known, their dreams are nurtured and they are empowered to become who they are capable of becoming.<br /><br />Love can sound abstract. At <strong>Zeta, it means something solid. <br /></strong><br /><strong>Love is whole child education:</strong> developing students academically, socially, physically, and emotionally.<br /><br /><strong>Love is safety:</strong> creating an environment where students feel secure, supported, and ready to take ownership of their academics.<br /> <br /><strong>Love is knowing every family:</strong> building meaningful partnerships with the people who know our students best.<br /><br /><strong>Love is academic rigor:</strong> believing every student is capable of excellence, challenging them, and giving them the support to reach high standards.<br /><br /><strong>Love is in our Specialties:</strong> giving students opportunities to discover talents and passions through art, music, chess, dance, sports, and more.<br /><br /><strong>Love is in our facilities: </strong>designing spaces that inspire curiosity, creativity, and a love of learning.<br /><br /><strong>Love is welcoming every student</strong> in the city to discover their full potential. <br /><br />Come visit Zeta High, <a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u>sign up for an upcoming event or tour </u></a>to learn more about us.<br /><br />We cannot wait to welcome your family to Zeta! <br /><br />Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br />Zeta Charter Schools<br /><br />Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta, our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way. ✉︎  <a href=\"mailto:%20enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><em><u>enroll&#64;zetaschools.org</u></em></a> &#x1f4de;(646) 480-1654<br /><br />"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
            "id" : "0f7b4f66-0f18-44a3-86e3-3023f71d3adc",
            "type" : "block"
          } ]
        } ]
